message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Identifier-Free Code Embedding (IFCE)"
abstract: >-
  Code for training and evaluating identifier-free code-embedding models that
  locate functions in embedding space by what they do rather than by their
  identifiers, using a contrastive objective over source / decompiled pairs.
